[{"title":"挽杨斗玉少参 其五","author":"孙传庭","text":"归来魂梦久相恬，困倚孤帏漫自嫌。\n颈厌鹤长难学短，味谙荼苦反疑甜。\n人情冷与秋风并，世路蒙如夜色兼。\n怪杀屈原原未醒，卜居何用拂龟占。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24614,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯忝生侍御还朝有赠","author":"孙传庭","text":"绣衣使者有殊庸，揽辔今看报九重。\n骢出吴门非众马，剑来丰狱是真龙。\n皂囊已吐台中气，白羽还销塞上烽。\n开府伫应承宠渥，还将雨露洒尧封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24615,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜不寐 其十九","author":"孙传庭","text":"气节文章世两难，真宜才子作言官。\n时英争睹囊中草，大吏犹钦柱后冠。\n按晋河山殊借色，趋朝霜雪正生寒。\n共知足副澄清志，不忝鸣阳一凤看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24616,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"焦涵一开府云中赋赠 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"名高台鼎风流诎，藻夺云霞竹帛难。\n天使文章兼事业，君能才子复尊官。\n行当自勒燕然石，更有谁登汉将坛。\n节钺非荣君可贵，范韩扬马一时看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24617,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"焦涵一开府云中赋赠 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"云中旧是濒戎地，警息新当出塞时。\n宵旰九重思锁钥，疮痍万姓望旌旗。\n交河跃马鲸鲵戢，广野陈兵虎豹驰。\n伫奏肤功膺简畀，愿将铙吹入歌诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24618,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留酌焦涵一于映碧园因邀田御宿同集 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"风雅寥寥我辈存，频年河汉漫销魂。\n怀中明月寒相照，匣里清霜晚共论。\n大白浮杯临水榭，太元题宇署山轩。\n高牙独讶催行急，一曲溪前夜色繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24619,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留酌焦涵一于映碧园因邀田御宿同集 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"溪水溪云冻欲连，空庭酌酒剧相怜。\n春风十忆金门柳，朔雪双看玉井莲。\n并有襟期存世外，何妨意兴满樽前。\n却疑鼎足非吾事，几傍雌雄剑惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24620,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日田御宿大参邀饮清宴堂晚复围垆畅饮益出内庖佐酒属余病嗽却饮为樊淑鲁计部所窘辄饮至醉即事 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"霜清紫塞罢谈兵，月满空庭照举觥。\n词客都忘天使重，酒人独有夜郎横。\n偶拈胜句吟怀爽，忽得枭卢醉眼明。\n纵饮那能宽病骨，狂来吾亦渺浮生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24621,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日田御宿大参邀饮清宴堂晚复围垆畅饮益出内庖佐酒属余病嗽却饮为樊淑鲁计部所窘辄饮至醉即事 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"尽捐苛礼叙从容，雅集何妨命酌重。\n兰室晚携人似玉，戟门初挂月如弓。\n坐深徐榻殊堪下，饮剧郇厨不厌供。\n解道春风生满席，故教此夜失严冬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24622,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王乐斋以幕府劄从戎索诗为赋","author":"孙传庭","text":"文雅风流已足观，援弓上马亦桓桓。\n不因有意麒麟阁，安得无端鵔鸃冠。\n匕首久从燕赵把，刀头莫向斗牛看。\n自惊儒服兵机见，知尔应登大将坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24623,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田御宿大参西归有日小酌草堂樊淑鲁计部同集限韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"相看欲别复何言，对月堪销此夜魂。\n归客遐心千里去，隐人傲骨十年存。\n雁行把酒悲燕市，龙塞谈诗忆兔园。\n南北天涯同努力，重图执手问华樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24624,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣病","author":"孙传庭","text":"病来不讶世缘奇，久病翻知病却宜。\n天上神仙如不病，月中灵药欲何为。\n姓名已落时人忌，诗句还生真宰疑。\n伏枕尽教儒雅废，渐还懵懂觉堪支。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24625,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张深之归里省亲深之雅负奇任侠诗意颇涉规劝知不足当一哂也","author":"孙传庭","text":"北风吹冷透征裘，河水凝愁冻不流。\n云绕高都瞻大麓，雪棼上馆忆并州。\n藏身莫遣千秋失，有母须教七尺留。\n我意独嫌君任侠，等閒未可试吴钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24626,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋赠袁临侯督学","author":"孙传庭","text":"柏台磊落振孤踪，直道终应圣主容。\n殿上昔惊人是虎，斗间今识剑为龙。\n文章自系千秋业，礼乐原推一代宗。\n吾党相期殊不浅，河汾佳士正云从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24627,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日偶成","author":"孙传庭","text":"为逢午日集园亭，遣兴持杯杯转停。\n病后伤时思艾畜，愁来览物感蒲零。\n綵丝疑效肠如缕，纨扇应怜鬓欲星。\n浩渺忽看溪上水，汨罗千载恨犹醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24628,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送卢靖寰大参之任西川","author":"孙传庭","text":"雄风万里动双旌，酌酒相看壮此行。\n花发锦江明驲路，云浮玉垒度山城。\n文翁旧化风应好，汉檄新传寇未平。\n到日定知经纬裕，草堂遗老漫怦怦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24629,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥警 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"去岁游兵猎雁门，雄关虎豹自云屯。\n请缨漫切书生志，闻鼓偏销战士魂。\n草垛阴风吹白昼，桑乾燐火照黄昏。\n只今痛定方思痛，又见烟尘满冀原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24630,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥警 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"频年戎马任纵横，此日长驱气转盈。\n两镇元戎争料敌，一时健旅尽婴城。\n楼烦碛外朝鸣角，石岭峰头夜合营。\n燕壁晋藩俱咫尺，令人击目泪如倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24631,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别樊淑鲁饷部用韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"十年无复听和鸾，小草殊多此一端。\n曾羡陶潜能解绶，敢言贡禹爱弹冠。\n天高北阙风云远，地迥西溪雨雪安。\n强起不知缘底事，马头秋色正馀寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24632,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日同潘升允侍御薛行坞简讨宋泗洲验封集李龙门枢部宅漫赋 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"帝城佳节足追陪，良晤何妨结驷来。\n千里一堂今把袂，百年九日此衔杯。\n龙山客好仍同健，燕市花寒却早开。\n?醉尽忘归去晚，迢迢清漏漫频催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24633,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日同潘升允侍御薛行坞简讨宋泗洲验封集李龙门枢部宅漫赋 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"登高作赋本吾俦，閒馆清欢亦胜游。\n天入幽燕瞻上国，地连豫晋忆并州。\n从教月色开新爽，莫遣边声起暮愁。\n回首关河劳梦寐，南云北树几悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24634,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宁署壁间刻马端甫公咏竹诗而竹与人俱不可睹矣次以志感","author":"孙传庭","text":"偶从题咏想琅玕，春老空亭客梦寒。\n渭水千竿何处挹，沱阳三径几时看。\n残枝未许喧乌雀，遗韵犹堪下凤鸾。\n惆怅此君不可作，惟馀汗简照心丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24635,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈玉铉给事入都寄赠十二韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"圣代需鸿硕，天街俨驷骖。\n雄风空冀北，大业起周南。\n霄汉孤心映，乾坤只手担。\n琐垣秋冷烈，彩笔夜清酣。\n气向丰城识，珠从赤水探。\n直疑云可作，戆比黯何惭。\n犹忆同联绶，相期自盍簪。\n解牛知绝伎，扪虱想雄谭。\n世局今逾变，时贤理未谙。\n泽鸿方肃肃，嵎虎复眈眈。\n恤纬余空切，回天尔独堪。\n遥闻旋上国，聊此寄心函。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24636,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得看剑引杯长十韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"别有临觞意，非关饮兴频。\n琴樽徒寂寞，诗酒漫逡巡。\n狎厌东山妓，喧憎北海宾。\n胸原饶磊块，世未息烟尘。\n何物堪酬主，斯时合致身。\n龙精惊在握，虎气喜相亲。\n雷焕占非偶，风胡辨独真。\n芙蓉锷上灿，霜雪匣中新。\n睥睨怀仇齿，盘桓念蹇屯。\n连呼尽百斗，此际意谁伦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24637,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日二十韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"谷旦迎长至，昌期应大来。\n复临三极转，泰履一阳回。\n建子周为历，书云鲁有台。\n严凝初地拆，寥落乍天开。\n金翼驰南陆，璇衡指北垓。\n乾坤终不改，日月故相催。\n广漠占风远，元冥识气该。\n荔生乘岁亚，梅敛待春魁。\n真宰殊堪信，浮生漫自哀。\n有为皆骈拇，不尽是枯荄。\n半世吾将老，两仪尔更孩。\n斋居探混沌，兀坐辟喧豗。\n淡取匏樽酌，寒将炉火煨。\n忝亲多夙夜，报国少涓埃。\n久分鱼鸥侣，都忘鹓鹭陪。\n懒疑能惜病，拙敢望怜才。\n意气消三鼓，行藏滞一雷。\n绪添同绣线，名断异葭灰。\n冰雪馀心在，风霜任鬓摧。\n尽看时辈弃，合付彼苍裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24638,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日南郊恭纪同徐嵋云文选孙三如考功黄率行验封限韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"祗天大礼三先甲，罄地精诚七阅辰。\n正廑殷忧连下土，转思至德合穹旻。\n望灵夙戒勤将享，奉贽亲临毖祀禋。\n云绕郊宫华似盖，月依辇路碧如轮。\n儒臣履舄联双佩，卫士兜鍪挽六钧。\n气肃牲牷登豆列，光浮玉帛鼓钟陈。\n釐樽馨馥初将酒，燎火辉煌不尽薪。\n煖入管灰宵动玉，漏催宫箭晚传银。\n紫烟轻拂仙韶远，黄道重旋御仗新。\n肃驾凫趋环左掖，庆成嵩祝彻中宸。\n忭欢自叶迎阳义，抟捖知回造物仁。\n九塞无虞烽尽息，万年有道福长臻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24639,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题先徽录十韵","author":"孙传庭","text":"汉代君家盛绝伦，明时奕叶远逾新。\n一完白璧生庭玉，两获元珠擅席珍。\n出应祯祥同凤览，诞繇仁厚并麟振。\n积书早信儿能读，断织尝愁母见嗔。\n弓冶相承蒙泽永，埙篪迭奏此情真。\n衔鳣座上儒风古，扰雉田间吏术淳。\n即墨不封翻是罪，原思何病但宜贫。\n瞻云洒泪悲空罍，倾日怀丹叹穫薪。\n丘壑尚堪容故我，耕樵总不愧前人。\n天心倘在偏衡虑，世路难知漫怆神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24640,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别友","author":"孙传庭","text":"一樽风雨至，孤剑暮云横。\n意气知难老，何妨万里行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24641,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"人迹真难到，奇花自在生。\n原皆天女散，安得尽知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24642,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"引水遥通灶，裁山曲抱墙。\n高楼窥树远，虚牖纳云长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24643,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其三","author":"孙传庭","text":"天畔数声钟，听之清思发。\n独起步空阶，但见空山月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24644,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其四","author":"孙传庭","text":"细路何盘折，重经碧藓封。\n钟鸣知寺近，只隔数重松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24645,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其五","author":"孙传庭","text":"树起不见山，云生不见树。\n来往翠微中，衣湿非关雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24646,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其六","author":"孙传庭","text":"空林寂无人，清言共谁订。\n流水涧中鸣，泠然动我听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24647,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其七","author":"孙传庭","text":"一片清凉石，凭余任意眠。\n归来倘有意，不用买山钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24648,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其八","author":"孙传庭","text":"留骖僧罢磬，肃客寺敲钟。\n迎送能俱废，愿将幽意容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24649,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中杂吟 其九","author":"孙传庭","text":"辍卷入山来，搜吟非自苦。\n好景携不去，只合倩诗取。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24650,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡城夜眺","author":"孙传庭","text":"立马城头月未阑，楼台新霁暮空寒。\n客心此际真悲壮，指点欃枪仔细看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24651,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠相者 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"谁将姑布动公卿，洛下原来旧有声。\n一领青衣双碧眼，教人到处说髯生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24652,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠相者 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"曾闻早岁遇奇人，知汝传来骨法真。\n不为千金轻一决，偏将物色到风尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24653,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别萧武子","author":"孙传庭","text":"宝剑黄金赠远人，雄风万里动车尘。\n却怜一雨添离恨，愁杀长亭酒数巡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24654,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白鼻騧","author":"孙传庭","text":"何处驰来白鼻騧，银鞍金勒总豪华。\n笑看红袖飘飘处，道是垂杨第几家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24655,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"结客少年场","author":"孙传庭","text":"长袖翩翩白皙郎，紫骝斜控绿丝缰。\n等閒来往青齐近，为访何人是孟尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24656,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊行有感","author":"孙传庭","text":"涧底冻阴犹漠漠，岸头草色已芊芊。\n袛缘物理分高下，不是春光有后先。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24657,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许州道口仆夫偶折牡丹一枝置舆中","author":"孙传庭","text":"舆中忽见一枝春，带雨含烟自可人。\n正是洛阳饶富贵，穷途也得借花神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24658,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧生瑶来自西昌访余商邱十日辞去 其一","author":"孙传庭","text":"十载交游感慨中，清樽凉夜意何穷。\n送行冷署仍前度，犹有榴花似火红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24659,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧生瑶来自西昌访余商邱十日辞去 其二","author":"孙传庭","text":"匹马匆匆出宋城，主人相爱转相惊。\n知君欲续平原约，十日追随又远行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24660,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"孙传庭","text":"秋满长空月满湖，忽听征雁一声孤。\n远来应解传书信，曾到雁门关下无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24661,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻笛","author":"孙传庭","text":"关山杨柳尽飘零，远客含愁夜独醒。\n何处风前三弄笛，泠然清韵满空庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24662,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻柝","author":"孙传庭","text":"凉夜孤灯客思焦，柝声和雨度寒宵。\n荒村不是严更鼓，为伴阴虫送寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24663,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻砧","author":"孙传庭","text":"日落孤城秋气深，西风入夜转萧森。\n飘来一片寒砧急，敲碎离人万里心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24664,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张志南再归雁门","author":"孙传庭","text":"去年四月送君归，杨柳花飞点客衣。\n今日送君春正早，雪花却似柳花飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24665,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栖贤社","author":"孙传庭","text":"十里青松一径烟，嵩阳老衲此安禅。\n宽余许似渊明否，贤社何妨继白莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24666,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澡浴池戏题口号","author":"孙传庭","text":"圣水谁将澡浴名，不知智慧几人生。\n日来劫火名山遍，安得灵泉一洗清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24667,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万年冰","author":"孙传庭","text":"谁斧凌阴结玉虹，炎天赤日总难融。\n缘何不与夏虫语，此地繇来无夏虫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24668,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹林寺忆月川上人","author":"孙传庭","text":"高衲曾闻隐竹林，应怜空翠似禅心。\n一从寂后荒凉甚，明月川前自古今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24669,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广宗寺","author":"孙传庭","text":"灵鹫峰南半麓高，护持曾此荷宸褒。\n残碑漫讶沈苔藓，功德元逾铜瓦牢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24670,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圆照寺","author":"孙传庭","text":"圆照旌幢望欲遮，我来空自问袈裟。\n㫋■寂寞香花冷，几杵疏钟撞晚霞。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24671,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗㬋寺","author":"孙传庭","text":"一路寻僧苦寂寥，罗㬋寺里漫相招。\n番僧貌古言难晓，一语都无意较饶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24672,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闰中秋夜田御宿大参邀饮映碧园樊淑鲁民部以微恙未与书二绝见示依韵答之","author":"孙传庭","text":"银汉重看拂素盘，依然清影绕阑干。\n如何不共春风坐，露冷风凄觉夜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24673,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山北望","author":"葛昕","text":"叠嶂回旋处，蓬壶宛在兹。\n潺湲远浦度，蓊郁秀云驰。\n虎豹千官卫，龙蛇万岁枝。\n凭虚颙对望，佳气帝王居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24674,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊园偕西峪丈泛舟","author":"葛昕","text":"晓日临芳墅，簪联秘苑卿。\n层山回艇秀，新柳拂衣轻。\n鸟杂流泉韵，花传擿鼓觥。\n圣明大惠酺，身世总升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24675,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天宁寺次钟砺山韵 其一","author":"葛昕","text":"禅宇多幽意，招寻此共过。\n花芬袭委佩，露蔼带松萝。\n树老虬龙影，村深牧竖歌。\n三竿未下榻，不羡夜鸣珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24676,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天宁寺次钟砺山韵 其二","author":"葛昕","text":"幻海苦尘扰，避喧此地过。\n诸天俨法象，一水入烟萝。\n鸥傍矶头钓，樵传谷口歌。\n松簧来绝巘，清韵胜瑶珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24677,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠东升上人","author":"葛昕","text":"法王来西域，梵刹插东天。\n复阁松杉迥，浮图星斗悬。\n涛声酬鸟语，云影荫川田。\n乙夜无生话，尘心顿惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24678,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日湖上","author":"葛昕","text":"公馀湖畔赏，携仲步虚房。\n琴鼓清流碧，杯浮嫩菊黄。\n浩源通太液，远嶂抱披香。\n曲罢饶佳况，鸣榔夜渡湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24679,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]